    {
      "id": "ml-QTt1",
      "step": 0,
      "order": 4,
      "family": "coverage",
      "title": "Coverage: The exterior parts of the mosque tripods can look like a…",
      "text": [
        "The exterior parts of the mosque tripods can look like a normal street. These will sometimes have [enough information](https://goo.gl/maps/W1WVwXgZUmc7HzhWA) available (when moving) to be included in **pinpointable maps**, like [A Community World](https://www.geoguessr.com/maps/62a44b22040f04bd36e8a914).",
        "This guide has separate sections for the pinpointable and non-pinpointable coverage. You can choose to study only the coverage that is relevant for competitive maps, or all the coverage. Note, however, that the interiors of the mosques are not considered pinpointable, even though they are covered in the section next to their respective exteriors."
      ],
